00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:44.010
were all trumped up.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.912
But he was steadfast,

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:48.014
continuing to agitate the elite

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:50.583
